                "Value": {
                  "StringWithMarkup": [
                    {
                      "String": "Beta-D-galactose is a D-galactopyranose having beta configuration at the anomeric centre. It has a role as an epitope and a mouse metabolite. It is an enantiomer of a beta-L-galactose.",
